    "claim": "Straight-through causal eligibility adaptation on 64-byte blocks (accumulating errors over bytes 0-31 and adapting Byte-LSTM preactivations via tied transpose projection for bytes 32-63) achieves net compression gain over memory-safe parent while preserving exact roundtrip.",
